time Edge

scale slot 12s 6
row block
zoom 0-2

box proposer
box block

step Column line
  say A line joins the boxes of the column in at. Without carry, an envelope runs along it.
  proposer -> block [at: 0]
  now -> 0

step Next column
  say The needle waits in the unit until the line of that column arrives.
  proposer -> block [at: 1]
  now -> 1
